# 5. Branch choice at the first checkpoint: the sign of the lateral position in the tick in which the
#    course script's branch marker is consumed (frame 3959 here, $20FB60 incremented at $10207);
#    $208349 counts the decisions, $20834A.. holds them (1 = left = WEST / lower), $20060F the next course.
#    Lateral held at +200 until frame 3940, then -200: left (course 1).
include race_mp.inc
2600-3940 w16 $209038 200
3941-4200 w16 $209038 -200
2600 watch $20fb60 1
2600 watch $208349 2
4200 p8 $20834a $20060f
4200 exit
